              "id": "turn-03-choice-01",
              "text": "The neighbors upstairs have been very loud at night.",
              "feedback": {
                "naturalness": 5,
                "assessment": "自然、符合当前情景",
                "naturalExpression": "The neighbors upstairs have been very loud at night.",
                "explanation": "“upstairs”指楼上或楼下，是建筑内部说明方向的常见用词。"
